<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-PAST WINNERS OF THE ASIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PAST WINNERS OF THE ASIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran have won the Asian Cup a</p>
<p>record three times in the 40-year history of the competition.</p>
<p>Here is a list of the year, venue, winner, runner-up and</p>
<p>result of the final of each of the previous 10 championships:</p>
<p>    Year     Host	   Winner	Runner-up	 Result</p>
<p>    1956   Hong Kong    South Korea   Israel	 Round robin</p>
<p>    1960   South Korea  South Korea   Israel	 Round robin</p>
<p>    1964   Israel	 Israel	  India	  Round robin</p>
<p>    1968   Iran	   Iran	    Burma	  Round robin</p>
<p>    1972   Thailand     Iran	    South Korea	2-1</p>
<p>    1976   Iran	   Iran	    Kuwait	     1-0</p>
<p>    1980   Kuwait	 Kuwait	  South Korea	3-0</p>
<p>    1984   Singapore    Saudi Arabia  China		2-0</p>
<p>    1988   Qatar	  Saudi Arabia  South Korea	4-3</p>
<p>								    (penalties)</p>
<p>    1992   Japan	  Japan	   Saudi Arabia     1-0.</p>
</text>
